  "details": "In the attached videos (which I had to split into two due to Canny's 8 MB filesize limitation), I switch my profile's `bannerType` to `avatarBanner` and switch avatar immediately after. Sometimes this causes the avatar to revert back to the previous avatar immediately.\n\nThe videos first had two failed attempts, then a successful bug replication on the third attempt in the second video where the notification to change avatars happens twice.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Go to your profile, Edit Profile, Change Banner, set to a solid color, apply, save.\n\n2. Edit Profile, Change Banner, switch avatar banner, and in quick succession select another avatar from a wing menu and press the Esc key.\n\nThis is not reproducible very consistently, but this should be relatively easy to reproduce with a few attempts.\n\nExpected result: Changing the profile banner should not revert the avatar worn.\n\nActual result: Sometimes changing the banner type reverts to the previous avatar worn, immediately after switching avatars. Sometimes you'll see your avatar change to the new avatar for a brief moment, before it reverts back to your previous one. Sometimes it'll just give a notification that your avatar was changed twice and you won't see a change.",
